---
description: Authoritative journal source paths and financial regression checks
globs: "src/**,schema/**,lib/journal-*.js,lib/trade-*.js,v6/**,scripts/**,.github/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Edit shared implementations in src/core, Classic view in src/views/classic, V6 view in src/views/v6.
- lib compatibility entries and app/classic/page.tsx only re-export; do not copy implementations there.
- Generate the single-file V6 with node scripts/render-v6.mjs; npm run verify must reject stale output before build.
- Runtime and generated Worker use the same RiskMath functions; no override wrappers or second math engine.
- Add independent numerical regression cases before formula changes; keep financial tests mandatory in CI.
- Run mutation guards with node scripts/check-financial-guards.mjs: intentionally wrong formulas must fail the real regression suite.
- Keep Tailwind/Chart CDN and Inter/JetBrains Mono; no new application libraries.
